            <sparkle:version>1.0.15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.9</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Cubby 1.0.9 fixes closing the panel from the menu bar.

- Clicking the Cubby icon closes an open panel even when it has lost keyboard focus.
- Responds on mouse press to avoid reopening the panel during click handling.
- Allows the panel to close even if capture permissions have changed while it was open.

Your notes, clipboard history, and screenshots stay in place.
]]></description>
