            <sparkle:version>1.0.13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Cubby 1.0.7 improves opening from the menu bar.

- Brings hidden or unfocused panels forward when you click the menu bar icon.
- Improves panel behavior across desktops and full-screen spaces.
- Keeps the panel on screen when using multiple monitors or changing display configurations.
- Clears stale panel visibility after sleep and desktop changes.

Includes the existing first-time setup and in-app updater. Your notes and screenshots stay in place.
]]></description>
